          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Top_Quality_Remanufactured_Gym_Equipment.jpg",
            "title": "Top Quality Remanufactured Gym Equipment",
            "text": "<p>At Fitness Superstore, quality is our top priority. Every equipment goes through a rigorous inspection, testing, and quality assurance process to ensure that every aspect of your Fitness Superstore machines work perfectly.</p>",
