          "type": "block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rectangle_1869_3.png",
            "title": "Parent Company of French Fitness With 10-Year Warranty",
            "text": "<p>French Fitness offers high-quality gym equipment at affordable prices, comparable to top global brands. Our products come with a 10-year parts warranty and a 1-year labor warranty, excluding weights and accessories. Customers can inspect and compare our products in person at our showroom or via a live Facetime call, with assistance from our staff. Whether for a home gym or a commercial fitness center, we ensure you get the best value for your money.</p>",
            "image_below_link_url_1": "",
            "image_below_link_url_2": "",
            "image_below_link_url_3": "",
